# JOURNEY · feeding: /feed is the whole command. It drops one portion (FEED_PORTION, 30 pellets, one for
# every column of the shower), or whatever is left in the bag. A new game holds 60 food, so two portions
# empty it, and a third /feed finds nothing to drop.

clear
run /feed
expect 30  fish
snap one portion left the bag and falls into the tank
tick 30
run /feed
expect 0  fish
snap the second portion emptied the bag
run /feed
expect 0  fish
absent 30  fish
